flowchart TD
  A[A turn opens<br/>in the group] --> B{How is the next<br/>speaker chosen?}
  B -- LLM --> C[The app picks who<br/>best fits the moment]
  B -- Manual --> D[You choose from<br/>the character list]
  B -- Director: Cue --> E[Tap a character,<br/>then send your message]
  B -- Director: Action --> F[Tap a character to make<br/>them respond right away]
  C --> G[The chosen character<br/>replies in their own voice]
  D --> G
  E --> G
  F --> G
  G --> H{What next?}
  H -- Add another reply --> I[Continue without retyping<br/>your persona is never impersonated]
  H -- Your move --> J[Send your next message]
  I --> B
  J --> B
  G --> K[Shared memory and lorebook<br/>keep the whole group consistent]

